The data on orphanhood were used to calculate adult mortality rates, specifically t he life expectancy at 
age 20 (Table 14). The software pack age MORTPAK, procedure ORPHAN, was used to calculate the 
adult mortality rates. Please note that the mean age at childbearing (MAC) , a required data input for this 
